    <statement><p>Evaluate the definite integral
<me>\int_{ 0.5 } ^ { 1.5 } 8 \sec^2(x) \, dx</me>
Answer: <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>108.440939658623</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>SOLUTION</p>
<p><me>\begin{array}{rcl} \displaystyle \int_{ 0.5 } ^ { 1.5 } 8 \sec^2(x) \, dx 
\amp =\amp  \displaystyle 8  \int_{ 0.5 } ^ { 1.5 }  \sec^2(x) \, dx
\\ \amp =\amp   8  \tan (x) \Big]_{0.5}^{1.5}
\\ \amp =\amp 8 (\tan(1.5)-\tan(0.5)) 
\end{array}</me></p>
</solution>
